      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El mundo había salido del mar, verde y nuevo. La era de los dioses había terminado.",
          "en": "The world had risen from the sea, green and new. The age of the gods was over."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ahora empezaba una nueva era: la era de los héroes. Eran hombres y mujeres, no dioses.",
          "en": "Now a new age began: the age of heroes. These were men and women, not gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "No tenían rayos ni martillos mágicos. Tenían espadas, valor y un destino del que no podían escapar.",
          "en": "They had no lightning and no magic hammers. They had swords, courage, and a fate they could not escape."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta temporada cuenta sus historias. Y la primera es la de un herrero.",
          "en": "This season tells their stories. And the first story is about a smith."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se llamaba Völund, y podía darle forma a cualquier cosa con el metal.",
          "en": "His name was Volund, and he could shape anything from metal."
        }
      ],
