      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día los hermanos encontraron a tres mujeres junto al lago, hilando.",
          "en": "One day the brothers found three women by the lake, spinning thread."
        },
        {
          "es": "A su lado había tres capas de plumas de cisne. Eran valquirias, doncellas guerreras que volaban como cisnes.",
          "en": "Beside them lay three coats of swan feathers. They were valkyries, warrior maidens who could fly as swans."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los hermanos se casaron con ellas. Durante siete inviernos, las parejas vivieron felices en el valle.",
          "en": "The brothers took them as wives. For seven winters, the couples lived happily in the valley."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero en el octavo invierno las mujeres se inquietaron. En el noveno se pusieron las plumas y se fueron volando.",
          "en": "But in the eighth winter, the women grew restless. In the ninth, they put on their feathers and flew away."
        },
        {
          "es": "Egil y Slagfid salieron a buscarlas. Völund se quedó solo, esperando que su esposa volviera.",
          "en": "Egil and Slagfid went to search for them. Volund stayed behind, alone, waiting for his wife to return."
        }
      ],
