      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Muy lejos vivía un rey llamado Nidud. Era codicioso, y se enteró del oro de Völund.",
          "en": "Far away lived a king named Nidud. He was greedy, and he heard about Volund's gold."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una noche, sus hombres entraron en secreto al valle. Robaron un anillo del cordel y se escondieron.",
          "en": "One night, his men crept into the valley. They stole a ring from the cord and hid in the dark."
        },
        {
          "es": "Völund volvió cansado. Se acostó junto al fuego y se quedó profundamente dormido.",
          "en": "Volund came home tired. He lay down by the fire and fell fast asleep."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces los hombres saltaron y lo ataron. Al despertar, tenía las manos y los pies atados.",
          "en": "Then the men leaped out and tied him up. When he woke, his hands and feet were bound."
        }
      ],
