        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.08
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En el salón del rey, la reina miró a Völund a los ojos. Brillan como los de una serpiente, dijo.",
          "en": "In the king's hall, the queen looked into Volund's eyes. They shine like a snake's, she said."
        },
        {
          "es": "Nidud se quedó con la espada de Völund. El anillo robado se lo dio a su hija, Bodvild.",
          "en": "Nidud took Volund's sword for himself. He gave the stolen ring to his daughter, Bodvild."
        },
        {
          "es": "Luego la reina dio una orden cruel: córtenle los tendones de las piernas, para que nunca pueda huir.",
          "en": "Then the queen gave a cruel order: cut the tendons in his legs, so he can never run away."
        },
        {
